# PulseBoard (nextjs-saas-learning)

Learning repo for Next.js 15 App Router — SSR, SSG, ISR, CSR, API routes, auth, middleware, React Query.

## Layout
- `src/app/(marketing)/` — public pages (blog, home)
- `src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/` — protected app (sidebar in `dashboard/layout.tsx`)
- `src/app/(auth)/` — login
- `src/app/api/` — Route Handlers (mock backend)
- `src/components/demo/` — teaching demos only; keep self-contained
- `src/lib/` — server utilities, auth, mock-db, actions
- `src/hooks/` — client React Query hooks
- `src/types/` — shared TypeScript types

## Conventions
- Use `@/` path alias for imports
- Tailwind + existing `.card` utility; match existing spacing/typography
- Auth cookie: `pulseboard_session`; middleware guards `/dashboard/*`
- Keep changes minimal and focused; this is a learning codebase with intentional patterns
